  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "firework_terrorist_mapping",
  "label": "Person identified as a firework",
  "description": "The text 'you identify as a firework' creates an analogical mapping where the person (represented by the silhouetted crowd) is mapped onto the visual entity 'firework_as_celebratory_object'. The meme humorously equates the person's self-identification with the celebratory, non-violent nature of a firework, contrasting it with the negative connotation of 'terrorist'. This mapping is established through the ironic juxtaposition of the celebratory visual (fireworks) with the text's claim of self-identification.",
